<decision #verify-eidolon-workflow-architecture-boundaries.explicit-seams { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?>哪些目标差异可以被视为产品架构边界？</?>
  <answer { } (
    <raw-answer ?>资源、root、effect host 与 surface 必须各有明确 authority。</?>
    <decision-text ?>XNL/depa-flows 拥有资源语义，Eidolon injected roots 拥有工程布局，Eidolon actor/session/runtime-control 拥有 effect lifecycle，native tools/CLI 拥有公开入口；产品状态机与确认/恢复协议不得被旁路。</?>
    <rationale ?>把格式和宿主职责与产品协议分离，才能独立验证每个 authority 边界。</?>
    <evidence ?>mission architecture design、已归档 authoring 与 run lifecycle tracks。</?>
  )>
)>
